abstract: >-
  Notebooks, driver code and cached results that reproduce every table and figure of
  "Covariance-Informed Ensemble Score Filtering: Embedding Localized Covariance Geometry
  into Score-Based Transport". Each notebook is committed in an executed state and
  rebuilds its table and figure from the data beside it.
keywords:
  - data assimilation
  - ensemble score filter
  - diffusion model
  - covariance localization
  - surface quasi-geostrophic turbulence
